    "hermes-agent.nousresearch.com": "",
    "Kilo Code takes its session settings from its": "",
    "variable, and a project’s own": "",
    "cannot override them. We verified this on Kilo 7.4.17 on 5 October 2026. Hermes Agent connects over the open Agent Client Protocol: Fabric opens its session and hands it Fabric’s tools through a local bridge, verified on Hermes 0.21.4 the same day. Hermes needs a model chosen in its own setup before it can answer.": "",
